OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1785862079
OL,3,CMan, 44, charged with firearm incident
OL,4,Coutside Mosque and Islamic Centre
OL,6,FA man has been charged following a
OL,7,Ffirearm incident outside a moque in
OL,8,FYork.
OL,10,FNorth Yorkshire Police said a gunshot
OL,11,Fnoise was heard around 2.19am on
OL,12,FThursday (30 July), near York Mosque
OL,13,Fand Islamic Centre, off Lawrence
OL,14,FStreet, on Bull Lane near the city
OL,15,Fcentre.
OL,17,FOfficers later recovered an air rifle,
OL,18,Fand no one was reported to be injured.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G1/6
