OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1785862079
OL,3,CMan, 44, charged with firearm incident
OL,4,Coutside Mosque and Islamic Centre
OL,6,FA 44-year-old man from York, a white
OL,7,FUK national, has been charged with
OL,8,Fpossessing a loaded air weapon, a .22
OL,9,Fair rifle, in a public place.
OL,11,FHe has been bailed with conditions,
OL,12,Fincluding to keep away from York
OL,13,FMosque. He is due to appear at York
OL,14,FMagistrates' Court on 21 September
OL,15,F2026.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
