FL,398,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1785862079
OL,3,CMan, 44, charged with firearm incident
OL,4,Coutside Mosque and Islamic Centre
OL,6,FFollowing an investigation by the
OL,7,FNorth Yorkshire Police, the force has
OL,8,Fsaid "there has been no evidence" to
OL,9,Fsuggest it "was motivated by anything
OL,10,Fideological, hate-related, or
OL,11,Fspecifically targeted against the
OL,12,FMuslim community in York."
OL,14,FPolice have increased patrols in the
OL,15,Farea to reassure the local community.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
