PN,39704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1785862079
OL,3,CMan, 44, charged with firearm incident
OL,4,Coutside Mosque and Islamic Centre
OL,6,FSuperintendent Ed Haywood-Noble,
OL,7,FSenior Operational Commander for York
OL,8,Fand Selby, said: "This has been a
OL,9,Fworrying time for everyone connected
OL,10,Fto York Mosque and all our communities
OL,11,Fin York.
OL,13,F"In relation to the firing of the air
OL,14,Frifle, our investigation has not
OL,15,Fidentified an intention to cause
OL,16,Finjuries or distress to people.
OL,26,@pD@ROUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G4/6
