OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,398,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1785862079
OL,3,CMan, 44, charged with firearm incident
OL,4,Coutside Mosque and Islamic Centre
OL,6,F"As life begins to return to normal in
OL,7,Fthe area, our Neighbourhood Policing
OL,8,FTeam will continue with high-
OL,9,Fvisibility patrols over the coming
OL,10,Fdays to provide added reassurance for
OL,11,Feveryone in the city.
OL,13,F"I again thank York Mosque for their
OL,14,Funderstanding and patience during this
OL,15,Ftime, and also our community partners
OL,16,Fand residents who have given so much
OL,17,Fsupport to the intensive police
OL,18,Finvestigation."
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOUzD@OO]
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G5/6
