OL,3,CMan, 44, charged with firearm incident
OL,4,Coutside Mosque and Islamic Centre
OL,6,FWitnesses or anyone with information,
OL,7,FCCTV or dashcam footage that could
OL,8,Fsupport the investigation, is being
OL,9,Furged to contact the police on 101.
OL,11,FAlternatively people can submit
OL,12,Finformation anonymously to
OL,13,FCrimestoppers on 0800555111, or make
OL,14,Fan online report.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G6/6
